---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Home">
  <h1>3DLaw</h1>
  <p class="home-intro">
    A home for my projects, writing, and things I'm learning.
  </p>
  <p>
    This website is a work in progress and part of the learning process.
  </p>
  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>Writing</h2>
    <p>
      Many engineers, including myself, are initially drawn to engineering because of their never ending curiosity. "How do things actually work?"
      But, somewhere along their journey, priorities shift and interests change and that driving question turns into "How do I make this work?".
      A small change, but a meaningful one. One that replaces a desire for understanding with a drive for results. 
      These projects are my own personal attempt to rediscover that desire for understanding and this website is my way of documenting my pursuit. 
      (and also just interests of mine :0)
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href="/writing/">Browse my writing</a>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="home-section">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
